{"unit_id":"izwarm195__dsh-net-tools#card-zh","repo":"izwarm195/dsh-net-tools","commit":"7392ec55ca6db884821311d739859ddea72211de","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-tools 是面向 DSH Web 和 Desktop 配置的网络工具插件，在 DSH 宿主进程注册 net_fetch 与 net_proxy_status。net_fetch 通过可显式指定或自动发现的本地 HTTP(S) 代理请求网页和 API，也支持直连；它返回文本响应，跟随重定向，并提供超时与响应大小限制。net_proxy_status 汇总进程、用户级环境变量和 Windows 系统代理，并可探测代理连通性。适合需要从 DSH agent 获取网页、文档或 API 内容，以及排查代理配置的场景；不需要 API 密钥，可使用本地代理或直接联网。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-16","index.js:57-85","index.js:87-90","index.js:141-178","lib/fetch.js:263-326"]}
{"unit_id":"izwarm195__dsh-net-tools#card-en","repo":"izwarm195/dsh-net-tools","commit":"7392ec55ca6db884821311d739859ddea72211de","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-net-tools adds two DSH tools. net_fetch retrieves HTTP(S) text through a local proxy or direct connection, following redirects and applying time and size limits. net_proxy_status reports configured proxies and can check connectivity. Use it to fetch web or API content and diagnose proxy setup.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:12-16","index.js:57-85","index.js:87-90","index.js:141-178","lib/fetch.js:263-326"]}
