{"unit_id":"izwarm195__dsh-net-tools#caveat-1","repo":"izwarm195/dsh-net-tools","commit":"7392ec55ca6db884821311d739859ddea72211de","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-net-tools 可通过 net_fetch 请求用户给定的 HTTP(S) 地址；代理诊断还会访问 www.gstatic.com 的探测地址。请求会到达目标网站或代理服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:14-16","index.js:168-173","lib/fetch.js:263-294"]}
